WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome back to Bible Bytes. Today we are in Psalm 23, the Lord is my shepherd, I shall not want.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
And in John chapter 10 Jesus says I am the good shepherd. The good shepherd lays down his life for the sheep. Let's think about what it means to be known and led and protected by him every single day.
